      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting process was initiated through SolarQuotes.com.au and was clear and detailed. Total Solar Solutions were professional in their approach and advice regarding the system configuration and the vendor equipment they were specifying. Upon discussing the original quote they recommended Zenaji batteries based on my preference for quality and longevity over price.The installation was physically completed on schedule including integration of works to upgrade my existing solar boosted gas hot water to an electric heat pump. Some teething issues were experienced with regard to inverter firmware compatibility between the solar and battery inverters which was resolved by them over the following few weeks after installation. The system has performed exceptionally well now almost 18 months after installation.Total Solar Solutions completed all the necessary paperwork to have my system connected to the grid and have been exceptionally helpful in supporting their product post installation answering all of my questions.",
