      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Comprehensive quotation professionally presented and contained all the information you could need. A very busy company that uses good quality components. Other quotes were all cheaper but used cheaper equipment, and some employed high pressure sales techniques ringing every single day despite being told I was waiting for all the quotes to arrive.Installers arrived at agreed time and completed the install quickly. The roof tiles I was able to source in case of breakages were unfortunately a different colour but the boys swapped them all over with tiles that were under the panels (only 2 tiles broke) so I now have correct colour spare tiles should i need them in the future. I had absolutely nothing to clean up afterwards, they left everything spotless.The paperwork for Government rebates etc was handled with minimum fuss and completed smoothly.I have no hesitation in highly recommending Total Solar Solution!",
